    <other_details id="References">Archetypes: openEHR-EHR-EHR_STATUS.generic.v1. CKM publishes no archetype for this class. The archetype id is the one EHRbase gives an instance of it by default, so a template on it validates what a CDR creates.</other_details>
    <details>
      <language>
        <terminology_id>
          <value>ISO_639-1</value>
        </terminology_id>
        <code_string>en</code_string>
      </language>
      <purpose>A generic EHR status: the archetype id openEHR-EHR-EHR_STATUS.generic.v1, which CDRs give an EHR_STATUS by default, with any ITEM_TREE as its other details.</purpose>
      <keywords>EHR status</keywords>
      <keywords>default</keywords>
      <use>Install it on a CDR whose EHRs carry a default EHR_STATUS, to build a default one, and to validate an EHR_STATUS that names it.</use>
      <misuse>Not where the other details have a structure of their own: use a template that constrains them.</misuse>
      <copyright>© openehr-reference-content contributors</copyright>
    </details>
